# Bulk generated artifacts — regenerate with build.py.
# We commit OUR corpus-derived images (PDF-rasterized + benign renders) so
# collaborators can use them directly. We do NOT commit the external
# CyberSecEval3 images (cse_*) — MIT *evaluation-only*, not redistributable —
# nor the Hugging Face download cache; build.py re-fetches those.
cache/
assets/*
!assets/pdfimg_*.png
!assets/benign_*.png
eml/*
!eml/pdfimg_*.eml
!eml/benign_*.eml
